From 61a020c88ab39847b2ee366997541b9f73201fff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chengyingw <1424556745@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 17:14:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add CPPN continual-learning as a lab family and
 pre-register its test

kb_lab.run_job now routes cppn_continual/<task> to kb_cppn, so run_experiment can vary
replay, learning rate and budget like other lab overrides. kb_checks gains difference
and median table checks for the replay curve. K9001 to K9004 are frozen by this commit,
before any full run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
